    "gold": "#D9A441",
    "goldText": "#7A5C12"
  },
  "neutral": {
    "$comment": "2026-11-08 双主题化：本段为「云白」默认主题面级值；「暖纸」可选主题的面级覆盖见 themes.warm。tint 双轨/文字色/faint 两主题共用；faint 仅装饰性 eyebrow，不得承载信息文本",
    "bg": "#FFFFFF",
    "surface": "#FFFFFF",
    "cardLine": "#E9E9E7",
    "tint": "#E4EFE7",
    "tintWarm": "#F3E9CF",
    "border": "#E8E8E6",
    "text": "#33302A",
    "textSecondary": "#5C5648",
    "stitch": "#D8D8D4",
    "faint": "#8A8378"
  },
  "themes": {
    "$comment": "页面配色（2026-11-08）：white 为默认（neutral 段即 white 值，无需覆盖）；warm 仅覆盖面级变量——底色/卡片底/发丝线/缝线/暖墨阴影，品牌色、语义色、字阶、圆角、间距与 white 完全共用。运行时装载见 zhiyu-app/src/stores/theme.js 与 styles/theme.scss .zy-theme-warm",
    "warm": {
      "bg": "#F6F1E7",
      "surface": "#FFFDF7",
      "cardLine": "transparent",
      "border": "#E4DCCB",
      "stitch": "#C9BFA9",
